<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pull up, RATTATA!\rRun up on ’em! Go for the ankles!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bro! This a PRIVATE scrap!\fGo watch somebody else’s beef!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme drop some knowledge. Your homie\nswing as long as it got PP.\rPP run out, the move done. Like\nmy gym membership.\rThen roll your homies to the\nTrap House. Free healthcare, baby!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme drop some knowledge. Your homie\nswing as long as it got PP.\rPP run out, the move done. Like\nmy gym membership.\rThen roll your homies to the\nTrap House. Free healthcare, baby!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t in no gang. I’m in a BOOK CLUB.\rBut if you look one of us in the eyes,\nyou better have read the chapter.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, lil bro!\rHow you walk right past my crib?\nIt’s the nicest crib on the block!\fHold up right there!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Up north that way is\nMr. Pokémon’s spot.\rBut before you go, lemme\nfinish talkin’.\rYou ever dig through a bush?\fPeople stash ALL kinda stuff in ’em.\fGator hide. Velvet. One sock.\rTake the scraps to Kurt and he’ll\fmake you custom bags. Real leather.\rThey mad useful.\rI feel like this meant to be,\n’cause I got somethin’ for you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With that Stash Box, you can carry\na whole lotta scraps.\rYou gon’ be a real bush plug!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 30\nSouth to Cherrygrove City</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Pokémon’s Spot\nStraight Ahead!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Pokémon’s Spot</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Street Rules\rDon’t steal nobody else’s homies!\rNap Sacks only get thrown at\nhomies that ain’t claimed!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you got Runnin’ Shoes now?\nLook at you, all athletic.\rBut runnin’ make noise. The opps\nin the grass hear you comin’.\fWalk like you owe somebody bread.</language>
	</row>
</body>
